+## Symlinks
+
+Symlinks in zip and squashfs archives are skipped unless `-l/--links`
+is used. With `--links` they are listed under their name plus the
+`.rclonelink` suffix and read back as the link target, so they can be
+copied to a destination which supports symlinks.
+
